[{"title":"返辰州 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"生憎江草唤愁生，闷见垂杨暗古城。\n隔岁家山仍北望，五溪烟瘴返南征。\n闾阎未报宽租税，轩冕空嗟拂性情。\n岁岁深岩求大木，不知陵庙几时成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57331,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"返辰州 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"满江烟浪一官舟，直指巡行遍几州。\n楚国封疆通塞徼，庾公江汉盛风流。\n飞鸢堕地还苍水，瘴岭愁人易白头。\n五柳先生真傲吏，暂来彭泽即归休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57332,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石壁","author":"顾璘","text":"一水回流抱古原，两山对起立江门。\n崩厓半出溪心渚，古木斜悬石背根。\n远见虞罗伤翠鸟，时逢洞穴羡苍猿。\n摐金伐鼓劳生地，不及渔竿弄晓昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57333,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风作","author":"顾璘","text":"乘船休谓逸，便有阻风愁。\n且任鼋鼍势，谁同鸥鹭谋。\n病多休对酒，岸近一登丘。\n满目凄凄草，王孙怨薄游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57334,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大风","author":"顾璘","text":"白波飞舞雪山摧，苍野喧轰万壑雷。\n猛势欲翻坤轴侧，大声遥向昊穹来。\n昆阳虎豹寒应慄，瀚海鱼龙倒却回。\n有客披襟还借问，此中噫气为谁哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57335,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辰沅之间","author":"顾璘","text":"武陵西上酉溪东，信有仙源不可穷。\n峭壁凌空欲飞起，淡烟临午亦空濛。\n舟从镜里移丹鹢，水向云边挂白虹。\n何处招寻陶谢手，恣渠挥笔竞才雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57336,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过壶头山","author":"顾璘","text":"伏波兵甲驻壶头，南望蛮烟泣楚囚。\n马革里尸徒尔尔，兽心回面竟悠悠。\n愁闻鬼域凭岩隐，怕见虫蛇出浪游。\n万里枉开秦汉土，九围元拱帝王州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57337,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻客谈桃源诸仙","author":"顾璘","text":"瞿桐石上千年树，桃老川边满目花。\n钟鼎误人空老去，不如来此学飧霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57338,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武溪滩","author":"顾璘","text":"乱石当流奋虎牙，扁舟飞出浪前花。\n瞿塘象马何如此，猿声休自怨三巴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57339,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上石峰","author":"顾璘","text":"江上青峦映碧空，垂岩花叶飐春风。\n楼船荡桨开帘去，忘却行人是客中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57340,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵呈陈兵侍高吾杨太仆闻山二年丈兼自述三首 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"东山归卧久，何日理安车。\n待月桥临沼，吟风竹满墟。\n道高公望属，心远俗尘袪。\n白首枢衡地，经纶力有馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57341,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵呈陈兵侍高吾杨太仆闻山二年丈兼自述三首 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"暂辟留侯谷，聊巾陶令车。\n清风高省阁，礼俗变乡墟。\n庭晓鹤常报，座寒蝇自袪。\n峥嵘康济略，仍在笑谈馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57342,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵呈陈兵侍高吾杨太仆闻山二年丈兼自述三首 其三","author":"顾璘","text":"偶回驱犊手，来上画熊车。\n问俗仍周史，扬旌漫楚墟。\n凤麟忻并睹，豺虎叹何袪。\n直道三王化，空怀百代馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57343,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答闻山 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"远至逢今雨，相逢叹曙星。\n云披瞻北斗，龙卧近南溟。\n醒酒无奇石，谈玄只旧亭。\n雷陈居接近，笑傲共岩扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57344,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答闻山 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"实少匡时策，虚传拙政声。\n中台惭宠命，倒囷负鳏茕。\n访旧春生座，论诗雨满城。\n最忻高士侧，下榻领深荣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57345,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再次答高吾 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"麟阁终当画，鸥波此暂盟。\n冥鸿霄汉志，野鹤水云情。\n按剑心长远，传经草渐成。\n丈夫随出处，终不负平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57346,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再次答高吾 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"不畏羊肠坂，遥寻雁塔盟。\n风波悲往事，云月见高情。\n技笑飞鼯尽，名嫌画虎成。\n还思万松坞，种麦了馀生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57347,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"避洞庭取道安乡山行自嘲","author":"顾璘","text":"宗悫破浪思长风，而我取道行山中。\n人间祸福岂自料，古人意气真豪雄。\n何不高挂十幅篷，飞桡直渡冯夷宫。\n岳阳楼前望夏口，月明吹笛楚江东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57348,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安乡晓发","author":"顾璘","text":"缺月尚中天，残星落落悬。\n露寒蛙不噪，草暗蝶犹眠。\n病怯春衣减，行妨野水连。\n老农乘雨过，相并理畬田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57349,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵寄答九峰徵君","author":"顾璘","text":"道许心交密，诗传醉墨温。\n乡闾称丈行，艺苑服专门。\n花月台端瑟，江云树下尊。\n何时分一座，谑浪睨乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57350,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗简翁去秋梦余赋诗见寄经春始达次韵奉复","author":"顾璘","text":"题封入手移春月，离别经心属暮年。\n交谊拟同泉石老，宦情惭被简书牵。\n山中耆旧诗谁健，江上形容梦独悬。\n细捲瑶笺藏箧笥，子孙他日会相传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57351,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华容马上","author":"顾璘","text":"白马朱幩不动尘，豸袍龙剑照青春。\n多忧敢谓先天下，拙用真惭对古人。\n万事推移心匪石，百年衰病鬓如银。\n经纶本属当朝杰，懒慢终随击壤民。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57352,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳州临江驿见亡友凌溪子题壁怆然兴怀倚韵追悼 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"滇海形容老瘴烟，文章惊代已徒然。\n谗多城市俄生虎，运去英雄莫问天。\n旧学传家今有后，新诗题壁迥无前。\n颜回子夏元方驾，何处脩文作地仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57353,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳州临江驿见亡友凌溪子题壁怆然兴怀倚韵追悼 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"鹦鹉才高失帝庭，人间穷达转冥冥。\n久将尘土抛金紫，自慱声华付汗青。\n避地盟寒空卜筑，招魂歌就或来听。\n笛声莫怆山阳舍，琴操期闻中散灵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57354,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳州临江驿见亡友凌溪子题壁怆然兴怀倚韵追悼 其三","author":"顾璘","text":"词笔飘飘压两都，当年声价许谁俱。\n争传庾信雄江左，竟误虞翻落海隅。\n友道金兰三世合，诗篇陶冶万人模。\n扁舟旧约江门路，千古伤心甓社湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57355,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哀按察华容八厓周公","author":"顾璘","text":"海内诗家流，按察名不细。\n仰溯风雅源，俯拾文选例。\n词锋捷如神，学海荡无际。\n洒翰迅风雨，旁视惊巨丽。\n士衡允如流，正平岂停缀。\n居诸几何间，充栋积篇系。\n奇葩灿繁英，野鹤抗孤唳。\n众人恶其上，转面生怒恚。\n矧兹豪士怀，高论激当世。\n万乘犹可干，岂复避贵势。\n铄金每潜机，下石憎毒厉。\n青云竟塌翼，黄壤俄挥涕。\n楄心愤难平，几欲愬上帝。\n观风临德乡，感旧重悲逝。\n惨怛堂上容，酸悽草间祭。\n结念江汉灵，愁云暗松桂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57356,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自嘉鱼挂帆归武昌三月晦日也","author":"顾璘","text":"蒲帆满驾顺流风，黄鹤楼台在眼中。\n柳色已经春候尽，城闉何啻故乡同。\n尘埃白发空奔走，岩谷苍生自困穷。\n万事关心无料理，漫芜瓜地国门东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57357,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登庐州镇淮楼同项守饮后作","author":"顾璘","text":"天畔飞楼谁搆成，画栏朱槛倚空明。\n江湖一片当窗泻，云雾千重对酒生。\n独立淮淝雄旧国，俯听弦诵蔼新声。\n夜深灯火同星散，不尽风流地主情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57358,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坐蕲州西池驿作","author":"顾璘","text":"衰年重作宦，入楚问民风。\n岂谓山川异，还嗟杼轴空。\n官常存国典，惠泽自皇躬。\n千里旬宣寄，安危仗数公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57359,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郑主事观兑运还京","author":"顾璘","text":"使君才调出群雄，来试萧何馈饷功。\n坐运军储轻在掌，笑吞云梦浩填胸。\n南征羽檄飞星过，西涨川波洚水同。\n圣主深宫忧万里，归朝何以献民风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57360,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠冯巡按孟元得代还朝","author":"顾璘","text":"君来祇见衡山动，君去犹闻汉水清。\n公辅眼中须屈指，别离江外独关情。\n霜飞归路秋仍肃，日丽高天道正行。\n宣室若承明主问，楚民皆喜罢南征。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57361,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄鹤楼野望","author":"顾璘","text":"黄鹤楼高玉笛哀，江声长绕碧窗回。\n孙刘去后空残垒，夏鄂登来有壮怀。\n重镇旌旄虚窃禄，荒洲词赋独怜才。\n乡关只在烟波外，何日扬帆破浪回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57362,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三弟舜玉六十","author":"顾璘","text":"仲兄官未罢，爱弟寿仍高。\n白首违琼树，青山落布袍。\n乡评元独重，酒兴近谁豪。\n却恨埙篪会，无因附尔曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57363,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨二首 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"雨声来夜壑，天惠洽秋成。\n自有神龙作，那同旱魃争。\n白波俄满眼，黄稿尽回生。\n六事桑麻责，君王本圣明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57364,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨二首 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"儿童沉蜥蜴，道士召风雷。\n人事空多枉，天心自欲回。\n时非汤世运，地薄楚人哀。\n云汉忧方剧，聊输笑口开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57365,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新竹","author":"顾璘","text":"犊角初穿地，龙梢倏过墙。\n孙枝高胜母，野色翠侵堂。\n林许清风入，人将俗抱忘。\n难逢嵇阮辈，终日弄壶觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57366,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日以杏实榴花馈开府谭公","author":"顾璘","text":"蜜脾已酿东林杏，腥血仍妆后苑榴。\n莫道端阳浑寂寞，也脩时令荐王侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57367,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄贺李序庵相公新第次浚川公韵","author":"顾璘","text":"天衢甲第丹霄迥，楼阁虚明望转微。\n海日重光开冉冉，宫云五采映霏霏。\n喜延宾客时分席，静玩琴书昼掩扉。\n退食从容无一事，愿歌隆栋荅垂衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57368,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄贺夏桂洲相公新第次前人","author":"顾璘","text":"天上神仙居有府，海中楼观净无尘。\n檐甍直捧丹霄日，竹树长含碧苑春。\n梦兆麒麟生蕙阁，文裁鸾凤赞枫宸。\n攸宁实荷周王宠，近市元非晏子真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57369,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入园偶题","author":"顾璘","text":"菜陇横斜竹径成，海榴红喷亚枝明。\n台居理得山林景，不负衰翁入楚行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57370,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠李户部孟川","author":"顾璘","text":"不识干将利，聊看试象犀。\n使君监楚饷，五月渡淮齐。\n逸气凌黄鹤，高才亚碧鸡。\n襄阳閒点笔，传满白铜鞮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57371,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旱","author":"顾璘","text":"楚困那宜旱，雷藏不肯鸣。\n苍天乖岁令，赤土废春耕。\n巢燕愁泥竭，池鱼怕火生。\n不知从政者，何以格神明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57372,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐见萤火有怀故园","author":"顾璘","text":"高城萤火夜深飞，带雨中林转细微。\n腐草馀光皆物化，乘风高举亦天机。\n流年过眼催仍急，浮客怀乡叹未归。\n义范堂前皃女小，绕庭团扇扑帘衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57373,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过冯子和新亭次答","author":"顾璘","text":"松筠手种待成阴，高士常怀出世心。\n正望蛟龙作霖雨，肯容麋鹿恋丰林。\n花烟拂座扶春醉，萝月窥帘伴夜吟。\n惭愧西台尘土客，偶来何解抱清琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57374,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池上有怀张水部","author":"顾璘","text":"江涛渺渺暮云阴，南去轻帆怅客心。\n雀舫暂停开省阁，骊珠频出动词林。\n芝兰并秀参差见，黄鸟相求上下吟。\n永日临池空洗耳，迢遥难近子牙琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57375,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后池亭偶坐","author":"顾璘","text":"雨过回塘新水平，镜轮圆印碧天明。\n贪鱼属玉浑忘去，抱叶蜻蜓忽自惊。\n吟处爱当芳树立，兴来思荡小舟行。\n台中饱食惭无补，不及垂纶称野情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57376,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月六日大雨用前韵","author":"顾璘","text":"六月六日雨如注，绕庭悬溜决清渠。\n不是太阳相避却，祗应知我腹无书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57377,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古城寺山与东皋公晚酌","author":"顾璘","text":"寺古仍临水，灯明更泛卮。\n共怀临海作，重对白头时。\n往事浮云变，生平皎日知。\n殷勤家国语，不记下山迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57378,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠润夫黄门","author":"顾璘","text":"昔爱仁人政，今传直谏名。\n采衣归暂乐，青琐贵非荣。\n门阀灵椿茂，才华汉水清。\n论交千载上，吾愿取西京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57379,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仰止吟为黎师召兵侍作","author":"顾璘","text":"眼中磥砢万文峰，俨立大贤为世宗。\n丈夫有灵塞天地，肯不拔地争巃嵷。\n朝亦一仰止，夕亦一仰止。\n平生积小以高大，巍乎山哉何愧尔。\n呜呼武公九十犹勉㫋，愿献他日攻玉篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57380,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南江吟为孙从一按察作 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"汉水东流散百湖，家家悬镜写菰蒲。\n锦袍独坐扁舟去，月里垂竿钓鳜鲈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57381,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南江吟为孙从一按察作 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"承天楼阁似京华，江上人烟簇锦花。\n直到东头高柳里，孤撑草阁伴渔家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57382,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南江吟为孙从一按察作 其三","author":"顾璘","text":"汉江龙起万方清，旧渚何殊兴庆名。\n使君家在新丰社，长沐枌榆雨露荣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57383,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南江吟为孙从一按察作 其四","author":"顾璘","text":"文武遗风江汉流，水滨游女绝思求。\n观风今值黄虞世，唯见溪翁击壤游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57384,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南江吟为孙从一按察作 其五","author":"顾璘","text":"入郢雄心笑子胥，仲尼书社总成虚。\n不如载取中山酒，来就江心丙穴鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57385,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南江吟为孙从一按察作 其六","author":"顾璘","text":"四面方城开楚都，凭将汉水壮雄图。\n神灵一统归今代，散与高人作五湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57386,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南江吟为孙从一按察作 其七","author":"顾璘","text":"西上襄阳百里程，摇船买酒醉樊城。\n接䍦堕却无心拾，杜预碑犹水底横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57387,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南江吟为孙从一按察作 其八","author":"顾璘","text":"我爱前贤太白豪，欲呼此水变春醪。\n四海清平身不老，与君终日醉蒲萄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57388,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南江吟为孙从一按察作 其九","author":"顾璘","text":"洪波吞却内方山，大别都来一掌间。\n伏腊移舟祠大禹，鱼龙窟里棹歌还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57389,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南江吟为孙从一按察作 其十","author":"顾璘","text":"我泛南江望汉阳，碧波千顷浩汪洋。\n使君度量元相似，何物艨艟不可藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57390,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江雨","author":"顾璘","text":"江流愁太溢，更遣雨添波。\n气逐阴阳变，天公奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57391,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄梁俭庵罢司徒归乡","author":"顾璘","text":"诏下天门许罢官，明王亲赐老臣安。\n十年大计黄金贱，六省清风白日寒。\n直道功名元自得，野人征税复谁宽。\n东门瓜地相邻并，欲拟投簪续旧欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57392,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄唐渔石司寇赐告归养","author":"顾璘","text":"横玉纡朱八座身，重闱列鼎百年亲。\n君王孝理先三事，司寇高风动万人。\n平法正资于定国，陈情偏奈范纯仁。\n中堂问寝馀清夜，还向深山礼北辰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57393,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉江独汎 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"水云蒸日楚天浮，满眼江湖伴客愁。\n三国雄豪何处问，捲帘犹自见荆州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57394,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉江独汎 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"郑生风骨岂超尘，水府能逢解佩人。\n青鸟去来烟漠漠，渚兰汀芷自含颦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57395,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉江独汎 其三","author":"顾璘","text":"三日楼船听棹歌，江湖归兴满渔蓑。\n功无铜柱长为客，浪笑壶头马伏波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57396,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉江独汎 其四","author":"顾璘","text":"郢城遥向武昌还，千里风帆三日间。\n直到汉阳聊舣棹，推篷先措八分山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57397,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"所见 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"襄河西溃水连天，禾黍翻成鱼鳖渊。\n鬻却儿童脩网罟，移家江口就渔船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":57398,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]